# cuda-ref: commit the .cu/.cpp/.h prototype SOURCE + README; never commit compiled binaries or build
# output. Build into out/ (see README). The `*` + whitelist also catches stray bare-directory builds
# (the nvcc/g++ binaries here have no extension, so a name/extension pattern wouldn't catch them).
*
!*.cu
!*.cpp
!*.cuh
!*.h
!*.hpp
!README.md
!.gitignore
